sal exits before any ledger entry). Drift vs the brief: the scan is no longer \"this repository's ledgers within 24 h\" (machine-wide + plan quotas; exit 1 added); a usage limit is no longer \"warning only\" — it refuses unless `-SkipPreflight` (finding #2/#3). Unproven: real MiMo quota/auth wording; no harness run (read-only). First real run should show `preflight \"ok: ...\"`, the MiMo lineage, effort mapping, extra_config, usage, and a parsed JSON reply.",
